InventHelp Inventor Develops New Wear Reduction System for Aircraft Tires (PTA-621). PITTSBURGH, June 11, 2026 /PRNewswire/ &#8212; &#8220;I wanted to create a wear reduction system for aircraft tires,&#8221; said an inventor, from Bremerton, Wash., &#8220;so I invented the CHRISTENSEN INVENTION. My design reduces the immense heat and force created by the violent speed change at landing.&#8221;
